---
// Pass-by-value stack frame copy vs passing a memory address pointer (*int) safely without arithmetic.
const W = 900;
const H = 282;
---
<figure class="gf1c">
  <div class="gf1c-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Memory diagram comparing Go pass-by-value copying variable x into a separate stack slot versus passing pointer &x so dereferencing *p mutates caller variable x.">
      {/* Left panel: Pass-by-value */}
      <rect x="14" y="14" width="424" height="254" rx="10" class="gf1c-card" />
      <text x="30" y="42" class="gf1c-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>1. Pass by Value: bumpByValue(v int)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>1. Truyền tham trị (copy giá trị): bumpByValue(x)</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="62" width="166" height="84" rx="6" class="gf1c-box" />
      <text x="42" y="83" class="gf1c-b">Caller frame (main)</text>
      <text x="42" y="103" class="gf1c-m">addr: 0x1400001a088</text>
      <text x="42" y="124" class="gf1c-b-ok">x = 10  (unchanged!)</text>

      <line x1="202" y1="104" x2="246" y2="104" class="gf1c-wire" />
      <polygon points="252,104 244,99 244,109" class="gf1c-head" />
      <text x="206" y="96" class="gf1c-m">copy 10</text>

      <rect x="256" y="62" width="166" height="84" rx="6" class="gf1c-box is-red" />
      <text x="268" y="83" class="gf1c-b-red">Callee frame (v)</text>
      <text x="268" y="103" class="gf1c-m">addr: 0x1400001a0c0</text>
      <text x="268" y="124" class="gf1c-b-red">v = 60  (discarded!)</text>

      <rect x="30" y="162" width="392" height="90" rx="6" class="gf1c-box" />
      <text x="42" y="184" class="gf1c-b">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Every Go function argument is passed by value:</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Mọi tham số hàm trong Go đều là bản copy độc lập:</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="42" y="204" class="gf1c-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>v lives at a different memory address from x, so v += 50</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>v nằm ở ô nhớ khác hẳn x; tăng v lên 60 thì khi thoát hàm</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="42" y="222" class="gf1c-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>leaves caller x untouched at 10 when bumpByValue returns.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>ô nhớ của x ở caller vẫn giữ nguyên giá trị 10 ban đầu.</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Right panel: Pass by Pointer */}
      <rect x="462" y="14" width="424" height="254" rx="10" class="gf1c-card is-ok" />
      <text x="478" y="42" class="gf1c-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>2. Pass Pointer Address: bumpByPtr(&amp;x)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>2. Truyền con trỏ địa chỉ: bumpByPtr(&amp;x)</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="478" y="62" width="166" height="84" rx="6" class="gf1c-box is-ok" />
      <text x="490" y="83" class="gf1c-b">Caller frame (main)</text>
      <text x="490" y="103" class="gf1c-m">addr: 0x1400001a088</text>
      <text x="490" y="124" class="gf1c-b-ok">x = 10 → 60 (updated!)</text>

      <line x1="700" y1="104" x2="652" y2="104" class="gf1c-wire-ok" />
      <polygon points="646,104 654,99 654,109" class="gf1c-head-ok" />
      <text x="652" y="96" class="gf1c-m">*p writes</text>

      <rect x="704" y="62" width="166" height="84" rx="6" class="gf1c-box is-ok" />
      <text x="716" y="83" class="gf1c-b-ok">Callee frame (p *int)</text>
      <text x="716" y="103" class="gf1c-m">p = 0x1400001a088</text>
      <text x="716" y="124" class="gf1c-b">*p += 50 mutates x</text>

      <rect x="478" y="162" width="392" height="90" rx="6" class="gf1c-box" />
      <text x="490" y="184" class="gf1b-b">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Why Go pointers stay safe for beginners:</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Vì sao con trỏ Go an toàn hơn nhiều so với C/C++:</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="490" y="204" class="gf1c-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>p still copies the 8-byte address by value, without pointer</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Go KHÔNG cho phép cộng trừ địa chỉ (p++ báo lỗi compile),</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="490" y="222" class="gf1c-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>arithmetic (p++ banned) and nil check before *p prevents crashes.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>và nhớ kiểm tra p != nil trước khi đọc ghi *p.</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Go always passes arguments by value: passing x copies its integer, while passing &amp;x copies the 8-byte memory address so *p inside the callee updates the caller's original variable.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Go luôn truyền theo kiểu copy: đưa x vào hàm chỉ nhân bản con số 10 sang chỗ mới, còn đưa &amp;x là copy địa chỉ ô nhớ để lệnh *p sửa thẳng được biến x gốc ở bên ngoài.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gf1c { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gf1c-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gf1c svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .gf1c text { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gf1c-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .gf1c-card.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gf1c-card.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gf1c-box { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gf1c-box.is-red { stroke: var(--red); fill: var(--red-tint-bg); }
  .gf1c-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gf1c-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gf1c-h { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gf1c-b, .gf1b-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gf1c-b-red { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .gf1c-b-ok { font-weight: 700; fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gf1c-b-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gf1c-m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 11px; }
  .gf1c-wire { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .gf1c-head { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gf1c-wire-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .gf1c-head-ok { fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gf1c-wire-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gf1c-head-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gf1c figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
